# YouTube API Quota Increase - Screencast Script

> **Total Duration**: 4-5 minutes
> **Language**: English (narration or on-screen text)
> **Format**: Screen recording with voice-over

---

## 🎬 SCENE 1: Introduction (0:00 - 0:30)

### Screen
- Show browser with YouTube channel page

### Narration (English)
```
"Hello, I'm [Your Name], the developer of AI Shorts Factory.

Thank you for reviewing our YouTube API quota increase request.

In this video, I will demonstrate our complete workflow, 
showing exactly how we use the YouTube Data API 
to upload AI-generated educational content for Korean seniors."
```

---

## 🎬 SCENE 2: Project Overview (0:30 - 1:00)

### Screen
- Show n8n dashboard (https://autoshort.site)
- Zoom into workflow name "AI Shorts Factory"

### Narration (English)
```
"This is our automation platform, n8n, self-hosted on our server.

Our service creates short-form educational videos 
targeting Korean adults aged 50 to 60.

We cover topics like health tips, financial advice, 
and lifestyle content - all family-friendly and educational."
```

### Key Points to Highlight
- Server URL: autoshort.site
- Workflow name visible
- Clean, professional interface

