## 🎬 SCENE 4: Media Generation (2:00 - 2:30)

### Screen
- Show DALL-E image generation nodes
- Show Kling video generation nodes

### Narration (English)
```
"Next, we generate visual content.

DALL-E 3 creates 8 educational images.
Kling AI creates the intro and outro videos.

All content is 100% AI-generated and original.
We do NOT use any copyrighted material."
```

