### Screen
- Open YouTube Studio
- Show "Content" → "Shorts" tab
- Show recently uploaded video

### Narration (English)
```
"Here's the result in YouTube Studio.

You can see the video was successfully uploaded.
The title, description, and tags are set correctly.

The video is now live on our channel,
providing valuable educational content to our audience."
```

### Show on Screen
- Uploaded video in YouTube Studio
- Video thumbnail
- View count / analytics (if available)

---

## 🎬 SCENE 8: Quota Justification (4:30 - 5:00)

### Screen
- Show spreadsheet or text overlay with numbers

### Narration (English)
```
"Here's why we need increased quota:

We manage 20 YouTube channels.
Each channel uploads 2 videos per day.
That's 40 videos daily.

Each upload uses approximately 1,600 API units.
Total daily need: about 64,000 units.

Our current quota of 10,000 units is insufficient.
We're requesting 100,000 units per day."
```

### Show Numbers on Screen
```
Channels: 20
Daily uploads per channel: 2
Total daily uploads: 40
Units per upload: ~1,600
Daily quota needed: ~64,000 units
Buffer: +36,000 units
Requested quota: 100,000 units/day
```

